<section class="section alt"><div class="container grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">Process</p><h2>A guided path from first brief to finished launch.</h2><p class="lede">The workflow keeps strategy, content, design, assets, and implementation connected instead of scattering decisions across disconnected handoffs.</p></div><div class="process-list"><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Map the customer journey</h3><p>Define lifecycle stages, owners, required fields, handoffs, service types, and decision points.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Configure the workspace</h3><p>Shape pipelines, views, permissions, automations, dashboards, and forms around real team behavior.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Migrate and clean data</h3><p>Normalize records, remove duplicates, confirm fields, and prepare imports before teams rely on reporting.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Train by role</h3><p>Give sales, service, leadership, and admin users clear examples for their actual daily workflows.</p></div></div><div class="process-item"><div><h3>Review and optimize</h3><p>Use usage patterns, stuck records, missed follow-ups, and reporting gaps to refine the CRM over time.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
